      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;p&gt;My partner and I are county caching across the US. We love to meet local geocachers. We are also ambassadors to next year&amp;#39;s Geowoodstock XXIII in Baton Rouge, LA. We hope to meet you and trade stories! No purchase necessary&lt;/p&gt;

