  <wpt lat="41.228213" lon="-96.023428">
    <time>2026-09-19T11:00:00</time>
    <name>GCBXK24</name>
    <desc>Talk Like a Pirate Post CITO by LadyCache, Event Cache (1.0/1.0)</desc>
    <url>https://coord.info/GCBXK24</url>
    <urlname>Talk Like a Pirate Post CITO</urlname>
    <sym>Geocache</sym>
    <type>Geocache|Event Cache</type>
    <groundspeak:cache id="10600084" archived="False" available="True" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
      <groundspeak:name>Talk Like a Pirate Post CITO</groundspeak:name>
      <groundspeak:placed_by>LadyCache</groundspeak:placed_by>
      <groundspeak:owner id="568858">LadyCache</groundspeak:owner>
      <groundspeak:type>Event Cache</groundspeak:type>
      <groundspeak:container>Other</groundspeak:container>
      <groundspeak:attributes>
        <groundspeak:attribute id="24" inc="1">Wheelchair accessible</groundspeak:attribute>
        <groundspeak:attribute id="6" inc="1">Recommended for kids</groundspeak:attribute>
        <groundspeak:attribute id="25" inc="1">Parking nearby</groundspeak:attribute>
        <groundspeak:attribute id="36" inc="0">Snowmobiles</groundspeak:attribute>
      </groundspeak:attributes>
      <groundspeak:difficulty>1.0</groundspeak:difficulty>
      <groundspeak:terrain>1.0</groundspeak:terrain>
      <groundspeak:country>United States</groundspeak:country>
      <groundspeak:state>Nebraska</groundspeak:state>
      <groundspeak:short_description html="True">&lt;b&gt;19 September 2026, 11:00 - 11:45&lt;/b&gt;</groundspeak:short_description>
      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#f39c12;"&gt;Talk Like a Pirate CITO Across the World - Bellevue, Nebraska USA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Ahoy, matey! Cast yer good eye on this fine scroll and prepare to talk like a proper buccaneer.&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Come join in the revelry and way yer tongue like a true buccaneer at The Salty Dog Bar &amp;amp; Grill. Plot yer course for &lt;strong&gt;3401 S 72nd St, Omaha, NE 68124&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;The horn sounds at &lt;strong&gt;11 bells in the forenoon&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, so there be plenty of daylight to plunder a few hidden treasures along the way as ye sail on over!&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Hear ye, crew! Muster all yer strength and &lt;strong&gt;don yer finest pirate finery&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; before ye step aboard! &lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;We be demanding every scallywag show up in proper buccaneer garb. Dust off yer tricorn hats. Strap on yer eye patches. Polish yer shiny buckles.&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Let no lily-livered landlubber catch ye in normal clothes! Show yer true colors or prepare to &lt;strong&gt;walk the plank&lt;!--TgQPHd|||[]--&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;As alway, no purchase to attend this event.  Please do not bring outside food or drink.  Thank you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://nebraskache.com/"&gt;&lt;img height="112" src="https://img.geocaching.com/9102f957-c986-41b5-acdb-a076bd017129.jpg" width="224" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://nebraskache.com/"&gt;Hosted By A Nebraskache Member&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/107321656812/"&gt;&lt;img height="68" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/gs-geo-images/19b6196d-f1d8-431b-9201-f4069d107ada_l.png" width="213" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;As the geocache event owner, I ensure that these links to a local geocaching group that is active in the community and contributing to geocaching in positive ways. This link has not been checked by Geocaching HQ or by the reviewer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</groundspeak:long_description>
