      <groundspeak:short_description html="True">&lt;b&gt;15 September 2026, 17:00 - 19:00&lt;/b&gt;</groundspeak:short_description>
      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;p&gt;This event provides an opportunity to gather with fellow geocachers to tell some geocaching stories, plan your next caching adventure, exchange puzzle hints and trackables,&amp;nbsp;catch up with old geo-friends, or make some new ones.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Kros Strain,&amp;nbsp;10411 Portal Road&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Weather permitting we will plan to meet&amp;nbsp;on the handicap accessible and dog friendly patio.&amp;nbsp; The fire pit will be going if it is cool, and if it rains there is plenty of indoor seating.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There will be a food truck on site from 5-8 pm.&amp;nbsp; As always, no purchase is required&amp;nbsp;to attend this event, just swing by&amp;nbsp;and say hello!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
</groundspeak:long_description>
