          <groundspeak:finder id="5202283">RBMAN</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">I was there!</groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="1384279734">
          <groundspeak:date>2026-09-13T19:00:00Z</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Attended</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="749127">billkat</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">That was yum!  Thanks!</groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="1384328106">
          <groundspeak:date>2026-09-13T19:00:00Z</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Attended</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="2043214">WadeLori</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">Great day for Geocaching, almost any day is good for that.
I love it when we get free time to go outside and play.

I'm on vacation! Where else would we want to go but Western and Central Nebraska. Just hanging out and finding a few in our path.

Thanks for the pancakes and sausage! Great way to start the day but end the event this year. 
All is well here!
TFTC

12555</groundspeak:text>
