      <groundspeak:short_description html="True">&lt;b&gt;02 September 2026, 14:00 - 14:30&lt;/b&gt;</groundspeak:short_description>
      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;p&gt;I will be traveling in the area and am so excited about arriving in Nebraska, I wanted to talk to the locals!  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Come meet me at this place where we can talk and you can eat a taco (If you choose, note that purchase of food is not required to attend the event).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hope to see you there!&lt;/p&gt;
</groundspeak:long_description>
      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>Taco Bell!</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
